{
  "about": "Registered displays for tools/test/gallery.py. Each scenario is one visual.py command; each display is a frame label it must capture (exact `label`, or a `pattern` with fnmatch wildcards and an optional `min` count). A captured frame no display claims is reported as unregistered. `apk` picks the prebuilt variant (bundled, default, or mapless). A scenario whose command accepts --test-apk also gets the frozen androidTest APK for on-device JUnit. `after` runs a scenario on the same emulator right after another, for state it inherits. Add a display here whenever visual.py gains a capture.",
